# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your values.

## Required (for Supabase persistence)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

## For AI features (set in Supabase Edge Function secrets, NOT here)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set via: supabase secrets set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

## Notes
# Without Supabase credentials, the app runs in demo mode with in-memory data.
# The demo data (Sharma family) is seeded automatically on first load.
# All AI features require a deployed Supabase Edge Function with ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set.
